{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/058a26ff624051b69b5f44298bac6734.avif?t=1758178963\" data-has-big width=800 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fruit-loving boy <strong>[Vimita] </strong>and his backpack-shaped android <strong>[Grandpa]</strong> team up in the action adventure to collect giant fruits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s explore the mysterious and fun theme park <strong>[Kajune Land].</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/6201eb3ca91d6e59ffc532c94e87cab4.avif?t=1758178963\" data-has-big width=800 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are lots of curious places in <strong>[Kajune Land]</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >juice river, sherbet hill, as well drones, robots, and even slides!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge fruits are hidden all over the park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/b3f585d89d561d7bdca712e0edeac731.avif?t=1758178963\" data-has-big width=800 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vimita and Grandpa work together - throwing jelly, vacuuming up fruits, and questing for hidden treats using a search function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the juicy and colorful world and collect all the fruits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Play a little or play a lot\u2014it's always Fruitimo! time!\u3011</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play Fruitimo!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw jelly, vacuum up fruits, and carry them to the goal!<br>Each run shows your results, so you\u2019ll want to play again and again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different Ways to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect only your favorite fruits, grab them all,<br>or skip collecting and explore Kajune Land in your own style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick fun in 10 minutes, about 60 minutes to collect everything,<br>or infinite play if you just want to wander. Play the way you feel today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to KAJUNE LAND!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3345000/86e7f9f91fbde520f8b8344a6ea3b88a35fb4043.jpg"},{"name":"Robot, you, my friend.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3345000/0c7c1bed93f29dba5d4cf139c8c177a87253676d.jpg"},{"name":"Hermit Craberry was there!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3345000/dbd5654582e39f95f110ac7d23e0d2a7ff04a549.jpg"},{"name":"Aim balloons!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3345000/4146b8901179c360ea0360ddefe7c9dd80f30fa3.jpg"},{"name":"Ouch!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3345000/7df5b679f7b845d53a4f2c93789bdc711a0a02d4.jpg"},{"name":"From the sky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3345000/8a8890ab6faa6ab5796506681135984d98fc2cce.jpg"},{"name":"Snow clearing Vimita!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3345000/e705f11c27ac7e7b828b6f0b0b623a1c7e87b3fb.jpg"},{"name":"Going up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3345000/03b2338c88bf03a40722e80efaec90864ddf12ce.jpg"},{"name":"Knock on tree","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3345000/06c8f098ee16eb7a75a3b7cc5b7c2ace5fdff8ac.jpg"},{"name":"Business interference","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3345000/6b1cf3ebeb80d440847714d06928802cf216458b.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3345000?t=1758178963","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/84cc274c36c6a3e3b61de2b9d0a3c302101fd8f8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758178963","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/5bf3b9f5ed1182cd4ccce2e807918a6435b022ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758178963","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/5bf3b9f5ed1182cd4ccce2e807918a6435b022ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758178963","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/058a26ff624051b69b5f44298bac6734.avif?t=1758178963\" data-has-big width=800 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fruit-loving boy <strong>[Vimita] </strong>and his backpack-shaped android <strong>[Grandpa]</strong> team up in the action adventure to collect giant fruits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s explore the mysterious and fun theme park <strong>[Kajune Land].</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/6201eb3ca91d6e59ffc532c94e87cab4.avif?t=1758178963\" data-has-big width=800 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are lots of curious places in <strong>[Kajune Land]</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >juice river, sherbet hill, as well drones, robots, and even slides!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge fruits are hidden all over the park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/b3f585d89d561d7bdca712e0edeac731.avif?t=1758178963\" data-has-big width=800 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vimita and Grandpa work together - throwing jelly, vacuuming up fruits, and questing for hidden treats using a search function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the juicy and colorful world and collect all the fruits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Play a little or play a lot\u2014it's always Fruitimo! time!\u3011</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play Fruitimo!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw jelly, vacuum up fruits, and carry them to the goal!<br>Each run shows your results, so you\u2019ll want to play again and again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different Ways to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect only your favorite fruits, grab them all,<br>or skip collecting and explore Kajune Land in your own style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick fun in 10 minutes, about 60 minutes to collect everything,<br>or infinite play if you just want to wander. Play the way you feel today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["PLANETA"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/b02cb45070a99be5e1abb3fbf46cd0eb37aca4b2/header.jpg?t=1758178963","is_free":false,"linux_